{
  "id": "acp-continuation-final12",
  "scope": "Final complete validation after all focused fixes. Two real ACP capability probes additionally retain failures, reserve global slots and assert typed teardown/phase receipts instead of brittle presentation text. Startup11 passed 10 repetitions before this stricter assertion. Runtime production is unchanged from final4; no timeouts, stack limits, product bounds or actual overlap/business assertions are relaxed. All original failed/interrupted runs remain separate.",
